{"suttaId":"tha-ap215","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7637,7655],"vripara":"11"},"segments":{"tha-ap215:0.3":"Saccasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap215:1.1":"“Vessabhū tamhi samaye, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhato;","tha-ap215:1.3":"Deseti ariyasaccāni, nibbāpento mahājanaṃ.","tha-ap215:2.1":"“Paramakāruññapattomhi, samitiṃ agamāsahaṃ;","tha-ap215:2.3":"Sohaṃ nisinnako santo, dhammamassosi satthuno.","tha-ap215:3.1":"“Tassāhaṃ dhammaṃ sutvāna, devalokaṃ agacchahaṃ;","tha-ap215:3.3":"Tiṃsakappāni devesu, avasiṃ tatthahaṃ pure.","tha-ap215:4.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ saññamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap215:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, saccasaññāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap215:5.1":"“Chabbīsamhi ito kappe, eko āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap215:5.3":"Ekaphusitanāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap215:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap215:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā saccasaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap215:8.1":"Saccasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
